---
---

<section id="work" class="section">
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="intro reveal">
      <div class="kicker">◇ Proof of work</div>
      <h3>We ship our <em>own</em> agents.</h3>
      <p>
        Advice is cheap; production is not. Eigenstack builds and operates
        Liv4All, a consumer AI agent that runs real people's lives every day.
        Everything we recommend to clients — evals, guardrails, agent
        architecture — we've had to make work ourselves first.
      </p>
    </div>

    <a class="card reveal" href="https://liv4all.com">
      <div class="preview-glow"></div>
      <div class="card-top">
        <span class="status">● Live · waitlist open</span>
        <span class="url">liv4all.com →</span>
      </div>
      <div class="mark">
        <div class="liv">liv<span>.</span></div>
        <div class="liv-tag">your AI personal assistant</div>
      </div>
      <p class="desc">
        A persistent AI agent that acts on your behalf — manages calendars,
        triages email, makes bookings. Not a chatbot. An agent that does things.
      </p>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding-top: 96px;
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }

  h3 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.6vw, 54px);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  h3 em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .intro p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 52ch;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .card {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    padding: 32px 36px 30px;
    background: #0b0b10;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    text-decoration: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    min-height: 340px;
    transition: transform 0.35s, box-shadow 0.35s;
  }

  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
  }

  .preview-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(
      circle at 70% 25%,
      rgba(168, 135, 255, 0.32),
      transparent 60%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .card-top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 1.4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    position: relative;
  }

  .mark {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .liv {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 72px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -3px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .liv span {
    color: #a887ff;
  }

  .liv-tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
    margin-top: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.4px;
  }

  .desc {
    position: relative;
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
    max-width: 44ch;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .section {
      padding-top: 64px;
    }

    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .card {
      min-height: 300px;
      padding: 26px 26px 24px;
    }

    .liv {
      font-size: 60px;
    }
  }
</style>
